{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56564","headline":"火记歌（幷序） 六 · 韩蕴中","name":"火记歌（幷序） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦节链成乾，修丹在志坚。\n虎伤龙带血，金杀木无烟。\n阳盛阴将至，荣来衰自然。\n撃声同磬响，观视得延年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩蕴中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}